<title>UNITED NATIONS: UN arms chief thinks Iraq still has missile force.</title>
<headline>UN arms chief thinks Iraq still has missile force.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chief U.N. arms inspector Rolf Ekeus  said he told the Security Council Wednesday he believed Iraq still had &quot;a significant number of operational missiles which could constitute a complete missile force.&quot;</p>
<p>While there was a &quot;theoretical possibility&quot; Iraq had destroyed those missiles secretly, it had not shown the scrapped rockets, he told reporters.</p>
</text>
